  "notes": "Columbia County listed one Republican COMMITTEE PERSON contest per precinct (42 precincts, Vote For 2, not gender-designated) in the certified 2026 primary report. A named ballot candidate who received votes is filled. Seats left only to write-ins are unknown, including where the report names write-in recipients marked (WI), because it does not say whether a write-in qualified or accepted. Seats with no candidate and zero votes are empty. Cleveland Twp had two candidates tied at 72 votes for the two seats, so both are filled. The report misspells two headers (REPULICAN Fishingcreek Twp, RUBLICAN Greenwood Twp); they are included. Appointments after the primary are not captured."
